From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:18:19 +0000
Subject: fix(android): bound vertical overscroll resistance

Vertical overscroll translation grew without limit, so a long pull could
drag a list (and its pull-to-refresh header) far past the viewport. Cap
edge overscroll at max(1/3 viewport, 160dp) with a resistance curve that
approaches the cap, and fix the sign of the nested-scroll touch path so
it uses the same curve.

Fork-Patch: android-overscroll-resistance-bound
Origin: 4b9b09aa
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

